        <obo:IAO_0000115>The chemical reactions and pathways involving glycogen, a polydisperse, highly branched glucan composed of chains of D-glucose residues in alpha-(1-&gt;4) glycosidic linkage, joined together by alpha-(1-&gt;6) glycosidic linkages.</obo:IAO_0000115>
