        <obo:IAO_0000115>The oxidation of hydrogen (H2) to water (H2O), using oxygen (O2) as the electron acceptor. A hydrogenase enzyme binds H2 and the hydrogen atoms are passed through an electron transfer chain to O2 to form water.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MetaCyc:P283-PWY</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:label>aerobic respiration, using hydrogen as electron donor</rdfs:label>
